			+ ASPEED Technology, Inc. ASPEED Graphics Family [1a03:2000] (rev 41) (prog-if 00 [VGA controller])

	o Misc Devices
		+ UART: 8250/16550A compatible serial port
			+ Serial controller [0700]: Intel Corporation Device [8086:18d8] (rev 11)
